            "@type": "Answer",
            text: "For most homes, a folding motorized treadmill with a powered incline is the most versatile choice. Regular runners, tall users and heavier users are usually better served by a non-folding machine with a longer deck and stronger motor. People who only walk and are short of space are often happiest with a walking pad.",
          },
        },
        {
          "@type": "Question",
          name: "What is the difference between a treadmill and an incline trainer?",
          acceptedAnswer: {
            "@type": "Answer",
